# No environment variables are currently required to run the frontend.
# The backend API base URL (http://localhost:8000) is hardcoded per
# service file in src/services/ rather than read from env — see
# .claude/rules/frontend.md.
#
# If you add a var, it must use the REACT_APP_ prefix to be visible in
# code (CRA convention). NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars are not read by CRA/webpack.
